    "text": "Source:CCTV.com 22-07-26 06:13 Updated BJT Font size: A+ A- As Director of the American Institute in Taiwan's Taipei Office, Raymond Greene has increasingly acted like Taiwan's \"supreme overlord,\" while Lai Ching-te bows and scrapes before him, willingly playing the part of an obedient and subservient \"godson.\"\nLai seems to believe that kneeling in submission and pledging his loyalty will earn him protection from Washington. But his humiliating cry of \"Godfather\" will never bring unconditional protection. What it brings is a tighter leash, deeper dependence and complete submission to another's demands.\nThey are here to take, not to give. The promised protection and backing are ultimately nothing more than a self-deceiving illusion.",
